{"chunks": ["Noveris demo source: Relational Database Design & Normalization\n\nFirst Normal Form (1NF) requires every attribute value to be atomic: a column\nmust not hold repeating groups or comma-separated lists. A relation such as\nStudent(StudentID, FullName, CourseCodes[Array]) violates 1NF because CourseCodes\nstores several values in one attribute.\n\nSecond Normal Form (2NF) removes partial dependencies on part of a composite\nprimary key. A relation is in 2NF when it is in 1NF and every non-key attribute\ndepends on the whole key."], "contentHash": "sha256:84cc30b6ef0736f630eda6fd6d5826b1555166069f9a652d5ad500b934394ca5", "courseId": "ad848809-c506-4f10-9d3c-729f6b2ee6b3", "documents": [{"contentHash": "sha256:84cc30b6ef0736f630eda6fd6d5826b1555166069f9a652d5ad500b934394ca5", "documentId": "doc_84cc30b6ef0736f6", "filename": "relational-normalization.txt", "mediaType": "text/plain", "provenance": "extracted", "storageRef": "originals/84cc30b6ef0736f630eda6fd6d5826b1555166069f9a652d5ad500b934394ca5"}], "indexHash": "sha256:c8b81c128e49ed4f7499564c492214c5a4882fb52dd1e9770433bbb93a495a47", "manifestDigest": "sha256:c7806e5cc706c937451621c3522ebb08caf7e8ee9e7bd39f78bdb4a1734efed8", "metas": [{"chunk_id": "chk_0ccbea4af1017b46510941b6283aa27d93d070f91cd7f28697b6fa68f2138e33", "content_hash": "sha256:84cc30b6ef0736f630eda6fd6d5826b1555166069f9a652d5ad500b934394ca5", "course_id": "ad848809-c506-4f10-9d3c-729f6b2ee6b3", "document_id": "doc_84cc30b6ef0736f6", "extraction_method": "text", "extraction_warning": null, "ocr_confidence": null, "page_number": null, "provenance": "extracted", "review_required": false, "revision_id": "rev_20261018_v1", "section_id": "section_1", "text_hash": "sha256:0ccbea4af1017b46510941b6283aa27d93d070f91cd7f28697b6fa68f2138e33"}], "revisionId": "rev_20261018_v1", "schemaVersion": "1.0.0"}